---
source: crates/scribe2/tests/e2e/fleet.rs
expression: form
---
usage: fleet <record|show|export|usage|select [--anchor DIR]> [--state-dir D] [flags]
fleet: no such run
{"schema":1,"kind":"export","host":"[host]","runs":0,"seats":0}
fleet: recorded RunCreated run=r1
fleet: kind InstallRecorded は record では書けない
usage: account=a1 unmeasured reason=token_expired refresh=ok
usage: account <add <label> [--anchor DIR] [--target T] [--tmux-socket PATH]|ls|retire <label>|restore <label>> --state-dir S
account: prepared a1 next=cd [state] && CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=[state]/accounts/a1 claude
account: refused reason=exists label=a1
account=a1 dir=present credential=missing config=present agentview=off trust=n/a retired=no five_hour=unmeasured seven_day=unmeasured
account: retired a1
